  "onboardingBmiDescription1": "The Body Mass Index (BMI) is a measure  that uses your height and weight to calculate if your weight for your body is within a healthy range",
  "onboardingBmiDescriptionAccent": "Body Mass Index (BMI)",
  "onboardingBmiDescription2": "However, BMI has limitations - for example it can't differentiate between fat, muscle, and bone weight. We'll use it along with other metrics to customize your program, but don't worry: It won't be the only factor that is taken into account",
  "onboardingLetsMoveOn": "Let’s move on",
